## Interface: 120100, 120105, 16001
## Title: Quick Cooldown Glow
## Notes: Glow the action bar buttons of spells enabled in Blizzard's Cooldown Manager (Essential) when their cooldown finishes. Local build: unset spells default to a 1 second glow; Persistent/None are still selectable.
